      "sourceTextSha256": "4564f706daf9091a4b6964b47ffd7c728a85e73a3426eaac24a2db927464da93",
      "text": "Day 15 · Transfer to the bus station for the shared tourist bus to Cusco. Stops along the way: Pucará, centre of the pre-Inca culture of the same name; the La Raya pass at more than 4,300 metres, with a roadside market against a mountain backdrop; lunch in Sicuani; the Inca site of Raqchi; and Andahuaylillas, the “Sistine Chapel of the Americas”. Evening arrival at Cusco bus station and transfer to the hotel.",
